---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/site/PageIntro.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME, COMPANY_LOCATION } from '../data/company';
import { COMPATIBILITY_APP_NAME } from '../data/products';

const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-10-20';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${COMPANY_NAME}`}
  description="How the ByteLite LLC website handles personal information: what is collected, what is not, which providers are involved, and how to request access or deletion."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" heading="Privacy Policy">
    <p class="small-print">Last updated <time datetime={LAST_UPDATED}>20 October 2026</time>. This policy covers this website only.</p>
  </PageIntro>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose legal">
      <h2>Summary</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>This website uses no analytics, advertising or tracking scripts, and sets no cookies.</li>
        <li>It loads no third-party fonts, scripts or images. Everything is served from this domain.</li>
        <li>The only personal information it receives is what you choose to send through the contact form.</li>
        <li>Nothing on this website takes payment.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the contact form, the name, email address, inquiry type, message and optional
        organization you enter are sent to a server function on this website. That function turns
        your message into an email to {COMPANY_NAME} and does not store it anywhere else.
      </p>
      <p>
        The email is delivered by SendGrid, a third-party email delivery provider, and forwarded to the
        company mailbox through Cloudflare's email routing service and the company's email provider.
        Each of these processes the message in order to deliver it, under its own policies. {COMPANY_NAME} keeps the resulting email in its mailbox for
        as long as needed to respond and to keep a record of the correspondence. Your information is
        not sold, not added to a marketing list, and not used for any purpose other than responding
        to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        To limit abuse, the server function uses your IP address to count recent submissions. That
        count is held temporarily in server memory and is not written to storage.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting and server records</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted by Vercel. Like any web host, Vercel processes technical request data
        such as IP addresses, browser information and requested addresses in order to serve pages and
        protect its service, and it may keep request logs under its own policies. {COMPANY_NAME} does
        not use that data to identify or profile visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not set cookies and does not store anything in your browser's local
        storage.
      </p>

      <h2>Payments, reservations and the Supporter Pack</h2>
      <p>
        No payment, reservation or purchase can be made through this website today. Checkout is
        switched off in this website's configuration.
      </p>
      <p>
        If payments are ever enabled, they will be processed by Stripe on its own hosted checkout
        page. {COMPANY_NAME} would not receive or store card numbers. This policy will be updated, and
        the change shown to you, before any checkout is switched on, including a test-mode checkout.
      </p>

      <h2>Products and research systems</h2>
      <p>
        {COMPATIBILITY_APP_NAME} is in private development and is not publicly available. It will have
        its own privacy policy before any public release. No research system described on this website
        is available to the public, and none collects information through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask what information {COMPANY_NAME} holds about you, ask for it to be corrected, or
        ask for it to be deleted. Use the <a href="/contact?type=privacy-request">contact form</a> and
        choose "Privacy request". {COMPANY_NAME} will respond within a reasonable time and in line with
        the law that applies to you.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This website is not directed at children, and some product pages describe adult products.
        {COMPANY_NAME} does not knowingly collect information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will change with it. A change that
        affects how your information is handled will be described on this page before it takes effect.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions can be sent through the <a href="/contact?type=privacy-request">contact form</a>.
        {COMPANY_NAME} is based in {COMPANY_LOCATION}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-ink-muted); }
</style>
